WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-IN

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:02.170
Hello friends, welcome to ManSamvad.

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:03.670
I am Heena Shah and in today's video,

00:00:03.910 --> 00:00:05.550
we will talk about how to select your

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:06.930
accommodation in various European destinations.

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:14.570
Yes, we have always chosen AirBnB for our

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:15.910
various European trips, that means apartments.

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:18.570
And today I will share various insider tips

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:20.890
with you on how I select these apartments.

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:26.950
Along with this, I will tell you in

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:30.630
more detail about our mistakes so that you

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:31.130
do not repeat the mistakes we have made.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:37.070
So let's say you have booked your flights,

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:39.390
you have also decided your entire itinerary.

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:41.810
Now it is very important to select an

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.490
accommodation because when you give your itinerary for

00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:45.150
Schengen visa, you will have to book an

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:45.650
accommodation.

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:50.150
But when you select the final accommodation, you

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:50.910
have to listen carefully to what all things

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:51.790
you will keep in mind.

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:56.170
When I have to book an apartment, I

00:00:56.170 --> 00:00:57.930
start shortlisting.

00:00:58.030 --> 00:00:59.830
So let's say I am looking for apartments

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:01.730
in Milan or I am looking for apartments

00:01:01.730 --> 00:01:02.230
in Lucerne.

00:01:02.590 --> 00:01:04.550
So I will start shortlisting the apartments on

00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:05.650
the website.

00:01:05.930 --> 00:01:07.430
I prefer airbnb.com.

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:11.050
So when I start shortlisting, if all the

00:01:11.050 --> 00:01:15.230
filters you have to apply match your requirements

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.950
and you have shortlisted a few apartments, then

00:01:18.950 --> 00:01:21.790
you definitely have to check the distance of

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:23.970
those apartments.
You have to check the price because that

00:01:23.970 --> 00:01:25.510
will be the first criteria that whether it

00:01:25.510 --> 00:01:27.530
is sitting in our budget or not.

00:01:27.790 --> 00:01:29.130
If there is a little plus or minus,

00:01:29.270 --> 00:01:29.810
then it is fine.

00:01:29.990 --> 00:01:31.310
But if it is out of budget, then

00:01:31.310 --> 00:01:32.390
obviously you will have to leave that apartment

00:01:32.390 --> 00:01:34.770
and choose an apartment that is in your

00:01:34.770 --> 00:01:35.310
budget.

00:01:35.310 --> 00:01:36.710
What are the criteria that I keep in

00:01:36.710 --> 00:01:38.510
mind while shortlisting?

00:01:38.690 --> 00:01:39.770
First of all is rating.

00:01:40.110 --> 00:01:41.750
Yes, I select the rating which is more

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:45.570
than 4.5 out of 5.

00:01:45.970 --> 00:01:48.090
Nothing less than 4.5 because you never

00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:49.830
know what has gone wrong in that apartment.

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:52.050
So once this filter is applied more than

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:56.130
4.5, then you will get to know

00:01:56.130 --> 00:01:57.890
what is left for you to select.

00:01:58.170 --> 00:01:59.830
After that, amenities.

00:02:00.210 --> 00:02:02.870
Yes, the first amenity in my filters will

00:02:02.870 --> 00:02:03.370
be having a kitchen.

00:02:05.110 --> 00:02:08.110
Having a gas stove, microwave, refrigerator in the

00:02:08.110 --> 00:02:10.350
kitchen is very important for me.

00:02:10.510 --> 00:02:12.450
So as a family, when we travel, I

00:02:12.450 --> 00:02:14.390
prefer cooking my own meals in the kitchen.

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:16.210
So when all these facilities are there, they

00:02:16.210 --> 00:02:17.730
are very helpful to me.

00:02:18.130 --> 00:02:20.010
So according to you, you can select which

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:20.970
amenities you want.

00:02:22.310 --> 00:02:23.790
If you are at the same place for

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:24.690
a long time, then maybe you will find

00:02:24.690 --> 00:02:26.490
the washing machine facility useful.

00:02:26.990 --> 00:02:28.250
And not to forget heater.

00:02:28.610 --> 00:02:30.410
If we are going to colder places, then

00:02:30.410 --> 00:02:31.830
it is very important to have a heater.

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:34.950
And if you go to Europe in the

00:02:34.950 --> 00:02:36.010
month of July-August, then it is very

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:36.550
hot there.

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:39.090
So in that case, it is very important

00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:39.570
to have an AC.

00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:41.350
You will still get a heater because these

00:02:41.350 --> 00:02:41.970
are cold countries.

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:44.550
But since these are cold countries, they have

00:02:44.550 --> 00:02:45.450
not installed an AC before.

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:48.510
Now, due to climate change in the last

00:02:48.510 --> 00:02:49.810
few years, the heat has increased a lot.

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:53.010
So still few places have ACs and most

00:02:53.010 --> 00:02:54.430
of the places might just have a table

00:02:54.430 --> 00:02:54.930
fan.

00:02:55.050 --> 00:02:56.910
The ceiling fan is still in very few

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:57.410
places.

00:02:57.930 --> 00:02:59.250
So see to it that in which month

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:00.310
you are going, whether you need an AC

00:03:00.310 --> 00:03:01.470
or not.

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:03.370
Check in the list of amenities.

00:03:04.010 --> 00:03:06.010
Again, one more thing, very very important.

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:08.490
If this apartment is in a building and

00:03:08.490 --> 00:03:10.370
on a higher floor, then what will you

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:10.870
need?

00:03:11.590 --> 00:03:13.050
Yes, lift, elevator.

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:14.050
Because you are not going to climb up

00:03:14.050 --> 00:03:14.910
the stairs with such heavy baggage.

00:03:17.310 --> 00:03:18.670
That will be very very uncomfortable.

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:19.830
This has happened with us.

00:03:20.410 --> 00:03:22.290
And I am telling you all these points

00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:24.910
after suffering something or the other in every

00:03:24.910 --> 00:03:25.410
accommodation.

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:29.330
In our first trip to Paris, our first

00:03:29.330 --> 00:03:31.450
apartment was on the fourth floor.

00:03:31.830 --> 00:03:34.210
And in the old building of Paris, the

00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:38.190
spiral wooden stairs, we had kept our baggage

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:38.690
up to four floors.

00:03:39.630 --> 00:03:41.010
So we have learnt a lot from our

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:41.510
mistakes.

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:42.930
I don't want you all to make such

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:43.430
mistakes.

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:45.770
So you can see in the listing whether

00:03:45.770 --> 00:03:48.830
elevator or lift is available or not.

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:49.830
Very very important.

00:03:50.270 --> 00:03:53.230
Similarly, whatever amenities you need, if you need

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:53.730
Wi-Fi.

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:56.270
And what we have, because when we are

00:03:56.270 --> 00:03:58.470
out, we do depend a lot on Wi

00:03:58.470 --> 00:03:58.890
-Fi.

00:03:58.890 --> 00:03:59.990
So see to it that Wi-Fi is

00:03:59.990 --> 00:04:00.570
in your listing.

00:04:01.830 --> 00:04:03.890
But it happens that Wi-Fi is not

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:04.390
provided.

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:06.610
So all these small things are there in

00:04:06.610 --> 00:04:07.110
the bathroom.

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:08.850
What amenities are there or not?

00:04:09.070 --> 00:04:10.210
What do I mean by amenities?

00:04:10.630 --> 00:04:13.530
So few countries, like when I was booking

00:04:13.530 --> 00:04:14.590
recently for our last trip.

00:04:15.269 --> 00:04:17.149
So when we were booking in Ayozta, NSE,

00:04:17.430 --> 00:04:18.450
all these places.

00:04:19.649 --> 00:04:23.750
Here, the normal essentials like your shower gel,

00:04:23.970 --> 00:04:24.790
like bath linen.

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:26.470
All these things are not included.

00:04:27.170 --> 00:04:28.910
At times you have to pay extra for

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:30.370
such basic amenities also.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:32.490
So be very very sure when you see

00:04:32.490 --> 00:04:32.990
the listing.

00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:36.050
What are the essentials included in it and

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:36.970
what are not included.

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:39.310
Because when we reached NSE, we had to

00:04:39.310 --> 00:04:41.310
go to the supermarket and buy shower gel.

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:44.330
So what happens is generally when we travel.

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:47.410
All these things are available in most of

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:47.910
the apartments.

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:49.970
So it never happens that they are not

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:52.290
there.
And unfortunately, at this time in my travel

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:53.890
kit, I forgot to take any shower gel.

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:55.670
So it does happen.

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:58.830
Be sure to check the amenities carefully.

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:01.050
Last but not the least.

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:03.550
In this list is that whenever you finalize

00:05:03.550 --> 00:05:04.270
any booking.

00:05:05.550 --> 00:05:07.170
So you have to take the code of

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:08.750
the door of the apartment from the host.

00:05:09.270 --> 00:05:12.930
Or the main door of the building outside

00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:13.430
the apartment.

00:05:13.810 --> 00:05:16.510
You have to put a code of that.

00:05:16.510 --> 00:05:18.030
You know 4 digit, 8 digit, whatever it

00:05:18.030 --> 00:05:19.970
is.
So take that code properly.

00:05:20.810 --> 00:05:22.470
Most of the hosts whose rating is above

00:05:22.470 --> 00:05:24.810
4.5. They themselves will provide you the

00:05:24.810 --> 00:05:25.350
full detail.

00:05:25.350 --> 00:05:27.670
In fact, a lot of hosts send you

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:31.750
the whole photo and video on messaging.

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:33.470
So you can easily find the apartment.

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:35.390
And you can easily find their door.

00:05:37.290 --> 00:05:38.610
In this way, they send you photographs or

00:05:38.610 --> 00:05:39.110
videos.

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:42.810
But sometimes it happens that they forgot to

00:05:42.810 --> 00:05:43.310
send the code.

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:46.490
Or there is some miscommunication or communication mismatch.

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:49.310
So be careful when you leave here for

00:05:49.310 --> 00:05:49.930
your trip.

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:52.030
So whatever is your first accommodation.

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:54.810
So check with the host how to reach

00:05:54.810 --> 00:05:55.310
that accommodation.

00:05:56.390 --> 00:05:58.450
Which street, which number you have to go.

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:01.310
And you have to put the code twice.

00:06:02.010 --> 00:06:02.630
First, you have to put the code in

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:04.210
the main building.

00:06:05.110 --> 00:06:07.450
And then many a times even their own

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:08.950
door also has a code.

00:06:09.570 --> 00:06:11.710
So be careful to take those codes properly.

00:06:12.130 --> 00:06:13.910
I am saying this because when we went

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:14.410
to Denmark.

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:16.270
We reached midnight.

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:17.710
Almost 12 o'clock.

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:20.950
And it so happened that the host did

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:22.510
not give his house number properly.

00:06:22.930 --> 00:06:24.130
And the street we reached.

00:06:24.510 --> 00:06:25.590
All the houses were the same.

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:27.930
When all the houses were the same, we

00:06:27.930 --> 00:06:29.050
were very confused.

00:06:29.310 --> 00:06:30.250
How to call them at midnight 12 o

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:30.750
'clock.

00:06:31.610 --> 00:06:32.290
Whether to do it or not.

00:06:32.630 --> 00:06:33.750
And in which house should we go.

00:06:33.890 --> 00:06:34.630
We were not getting any idea.

00:06:35.670 --> 00:06:37.010
Then we took a chance.

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:39.670
A house which seemed to be the host's

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:40.170
house from this photo.

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:41.630
We went inside that house.

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:45.390
After going inside, there was our room upstairs.

00:06:46.850 --> 00:06:49.050
In the whole house, on the first floor.

00:06:49.270 --> 00:06:50.870
She was renting out rooms.

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:52.830
So this was a shared apartment.

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:55.230
Initially, sometimes we used to take shared apartments.

00:06:56.290 --> 00:06:57.610
And then we went upstairs.

00:06:57.950 --> 00:06:59.010
There were 4-5 rooms.

00:06:59.430 --> 00:07:00.850
So I think she allotted all the guests.

00:07:01.970 --> 00:07:03.850
And after one room, there was a chit

00:07:03.850 --> 00:07:04.770
on the door.

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:06.910
And that chit again was not Danish.

00:07:07.270 --> 00:07:09.090
So we translated it standing there.

00:07:09.410 --> 00:07:11.030
After reading it, we came to know that

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:12.030
this is our room.

00:07:12.350 --> 00:07:13.650
And we have to check in here.

00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:16.490
So even a small mistake.

00:07:17.050 --> 00:07:18.350
Even a small detail.

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:19.750
If you forget to take it.

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:21.530
Then you can face a lot of trouble.

00:07:22.390 --> 00:07:23.590
So these are small things.

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:24.670
But be careful.

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:26.150
That you take all the details from your

00:07:26.150 --> 00:07:26.650
host.

00:07:27.650 --> 00:07:28.150
Next.

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:29.850
It has also happened with us.

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:31.710
That we reached.

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:33.190
Our first trip to Paris.

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:35.090
10 years back.

00:07:35.790 --> 00:07:37.530
The location that the host had written.

00:07:38.110 --> 00:07:39.010
We reached there with the baggage.

00:07:39.970 --> 00:07:42.350
We flew directly from India to Paris.

00:07:43.970 --> 00:07:45.550
So you know the host.

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:47.370
No key instructions.

00:07:47.670 --> 00:07:49.650
No details of anything.

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:50.850
And we were trying to contact the host.

00:07:51.770 --> 00:07:52.270
On his phone.

00:07:52.690 --> 00:07:54.170
And the phone was not reachable.

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:55.510
Another one more thing we noticed.

00:07:55.770 --> 00:07:58.510
Since this was my first international Europe trip.

00:07:58.890 --> 00:08:00.390
And this was the first time I was.

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:02.110
Experiencing booking Airbnbs.

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:04.450
So I didn't know that before booking me.

00:08:05.190 --> 00:08:06.130
What is the area like?

00:08:06.150 --> 00:08:06.830
I should check it.

00:08:07.330 --> 00:08:09.290
I made a big mistake there.

00:08:09.290 --> 00:08:11.010
So that area.

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:12.690
Was a very bad area.

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:14.870
So it was a complete red light area.

00:08:15.150 --> 00:08:16.330
And unfortunately.

00:08:17.110 --> 00:08:18.010
We had just booked there.

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:20.630
And moreover the host did not pick up

00:08:20.630 --> 00:08:21.130
the phone.

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:22.430
Now fortunately.

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:24.110
We had a friend with us.

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:25.230
Who came to take us to the airport.

00:08:25.890 --> 00:08:26.870
She was staying in Paris.

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:29.210
So fortunately she was there with us.

00:08:29.310 --> 00:08:30.710
She offered you to come to my house.

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:33.090
She was herself sharing the accommodation.

00:08:33.190 --> 00:08:33.950
With three other people.

00:08:34.210 --> 00:08:35.669
But she invited us to her place.

00:08:39.289 --> 00:08:40.789
Because it was very expensive in Europe.

00:08:41.210 --> 00:08:42.470
But we took a cab.

00:08:43.169 --> 00:08:44.390
From that place to her house.

00:08:44.570 --> 00:08:46.190
So we spent a lot of money in

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:46.690
Europe.

00:08:47.230 --> 00:08:49.270
And thankfully she hosted us.

00:08:49.270 --> 00:08:50.090
We had to stay for one night.

00:08:50.810 --> 00:08:52.050
She hosted us for that night.

00:08:52.290 --> 00:08:53.190
So be sure.

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:55.390
Whenever you book.

00:08:55.590 --> 00:08:57.270
Take care of all the small details.

00:08:58.710 --> 00:09:00.470
Of course after checking the amenities.

00:09:01.150 --> 00:09:01.670
Pictures.

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:04.510
You know it comes along with amenities.

00:09:04.930 --> 00:09:06.350
Whatever pictures the host has uploaded.

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:07.510
Look at the pictures properly.

00:09:09.290 --> 00:09:10.030
If you see any discrepancy.

00:09:10.450 --> 00:09:12.030
Then clear it with the host.

00:09:12.530 --> 00:09:13.690
And if there are very few pictures.

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:15.350
Then please don't go for that apartment.

00:09:15.710 --> 00:09:17.490
And if there are no pictures of the

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:19.430
bathroom.
Then also don't go for that apartment.

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:21.190
See to it that all the things.

00:09:21.430 --> 00:09:24.110
Bedroom, living room, kitchen, bathroom.

00:09:24.490 --> 00:09:25.870
All the pictures of the place.

00:09:26.110 --> 00:09:27.370
Have been shown to you clearly.

00:09:27.970 --> 00:09:28.930
And don't forget to read the reviews.

00:09:29.970 --> 00:09:31.210
Especially the latest reviews.

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:32.590
Read them definitely.

00:09:33.190 --> 00:09:34.950
And obviously the reviews of the star rating.

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:35.990
I read them first.

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:39.790
So that all the guests.

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:41.450
Give this host a star rating.

00:09:41.690 --> 00:09:43.650
Many guests mostly write in the reviews.

00:09:44.110 --> 00:09:46.090
How much distance is this apartment.

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:47.850
How much distance is the supermarket below.

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:49.630
How is the communication with the host.

00:09:50.090 --> 00:09:51.490
So you get a lot of confidence from

00:09:51.490 --> 00:09:51.930
that.

00:09:51.930 --> 00:09:54.750
Whether I should book this apartment or not.

00:09:55.070 --> 00:09:55.670
Location.

00:09:56.350 --> 00:09:58.530
I personally select the location.

00:09:58.550 --> 00:10:00.550
So that I don't get too expensive.

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:02.630
And I don't have to go too far.

00:10:03.310 --> 00:10:04.330
So what do I mean by that.

00:10:04.590 --> 00:10:05.350
I mean to say.

00:10:05.590 --> 00:10:08.250
If you select any location near the central

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:08.750
station.

